### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Create a to-do item
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy groceries",
  "description": "Milk, eggs, bread"
}

### 2. Create another item (no description - it's optional)
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write project README"
}

### 3. Create an item with a blank title -> expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "   "
}

### 4. List all to-do items
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos

### 5. Get a single item by ID
# Replace {id} with an id returned from step 1 or 4
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/{id}

### 6. Get a non-existent item -> expect 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/does-not-exist

### 7. Update an item (partial update - only send fields you want to change)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/todos/{id}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy groceries and cook dinner",
  "description": "Milk, eggs, bread, chicken"
}

### 8. Update with an invalid status -> expect 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/todos/{id}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "not-a-real-status"
}

### 9. Mark an item completed (dedicated convenience endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos/{id}/complete

### 10. Delete an item
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/todos/{id}

### 11. Delete a non-existent item -> expect 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/todos/does-not-exist
